# Shared Package

## Role

Single source of truth for enums, DTOs, WS payloads, `PushJobPayload`.

Consumed by: `apps/api`, `apps/admin`, `apps/mobile` as `@qpulse/shared`.

## Rules

- Export from `src/index.ts` only
- No runtime logic except constants (`TIMEFRAME_API_MAP`, `TIMEFRAME_DAYS`)
- No imports from apps (no circular deps)
- Enums must match Prisma schema values exactly

## Breaking changes

1. Update enum/DTO here first
2. Update Prisma if needed
3. Update all consumers
4. Update `docs/contracts/shared-types.md`

## Adding types

Mirror API response shapes. Use optional `?` for nullable Prisma fields.
